{"id":"gouverneur","lemma":"Gouverneur","pos":"noun","rank":1991,"glosses":["governor (male or of unspecified gender)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/59/De-Gouverneur.ogg/De-Gouverneur.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Gouverneurs","plural":"Gouverneure","feminine":"Gouverneurin"},"formAudio":{"Gouverneurs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Jeuwre-Gouverneurs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Gouverneur missbrauchte seine Macht.","en":"The governor abused his authority.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to abuse","l":"missbrauchen"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"to make","l":"machen"}]},{"text":"Der Häftling wurde vom Gouverneur begnadigt.","en":"The prisoner was pardoned by the governor.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"prison inmate"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"from the"},null,{"g":"to pardon","l":"begnadigen"}]},{"text":"Die Rede des Gouverneurs wurde in der Zeitschrift veröffentlicht.","en":"The governor's speech was published in the magazine.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"speech, address"},{"g":"of the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"magazine"},{"g":"published"}]},{"text":"Der Gouverneur begnadigte Tom.","en":"The governor pardoned Tom.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Alle wünschten, er wäre zum Gouverneur gewählt worden.","en":"Everybody wished he had been elected governor.","words":[{"g":"all, everyone"},{"g":"to wish for","l":"wünschen"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"sein"},{"g":"to the"},null,{"g":"chosen, elected"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"}]}]}